  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASHOKA I Grainotheque Animal Feed Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRAINOTHEQUE is an integrated holistic and territorial system that develops a synergy between agriculture and climate-smart farming to reduce post-harvest losses. The present project concerns a manufacturing and distribution unit for pig food made from raw materials (unsold products) purchased from small farmers. The main ingredients, necessary for the composition of food, are produced by family farms leaving in the West region of Cote d&apos;Ivoire.</narrative>
  </description>
